# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Asthana et al. (2024), MNRAS 533, 2843 (arXiv:2404.06548), Fig. 5 panel (c) (green dashed): hydrogen-ionizing emissivity per comoving Mpc^3 (no h).
#   "Democratic" source model: haloes >= 1e9 Msun/h, the same Ndot for every halo; 4 bins, H + He.
